  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/47ff5a35f14aedfbef907aa2ada72a7d28ccadaf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2035\" height=\"245\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>此资源包为&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations</a>&nbsp;添加了自发光与反射纹理！</p>\n<p>它专为还原官方《我的世界》预告片风格而设计，使用此包时，请将&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/bare-bones-pbr-x128\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bare Bones PBR x128</a>&nbsp;置于资源包列表的下方。</p>\n<p>资源包加载顺序如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Bare Bones PBR x Fresh Animations</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/bare-bones-x-fresh-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bare Bones x Fresh Animations</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/bare-bones-pbr-x128\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bare Bones PBR x128</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/bb\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bare Bones</a></li>\n</ul>",
